{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2054919698916278494","created_at":"2026-05-14T13:40:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2054919698916278494"],"id":"2054919698916278494","lang":"ja","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1909,"like_count":18,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"反复表达同一事物肯定很奇怪","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2054919698916278494"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2054805007137198220","created_at":"2026-05-14T06:04:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2054805007137198220"],"id":"2054805007137198220","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":6145,"like_count":102,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":15},"text":"好想有一段健康的积极的向上的良性的纠缠的扭曲的神经病的感情","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2054805007137198220"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2054651263011451141","created_at":"2026-05-13T19:53:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2054651263011451141"],"id":"2054651263011451141","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":24234,"like_count":392,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":53},"text":"大多数情况下 我都是默默流着眼泪到了一定程度我就全部都不要了 但也有小部分时候鼓起了勇气 诉说我的感受我的情绪 说完了其实就是我和别人结束的开始。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2054651263011451141"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2054648045065961474","created_at":"2026-05-13T19:40:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2054648045065961474"],"id":"2054648045065961474","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3418,"like_count":55,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":8},"text":"我好像既不能像纯理性者那样毫无情感包袱，也不能像纯情感者那样安心沉浸。我总是觉得我“应该”放松，但其实我内心的不安从来没有放过我。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2054648045065961474"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2054647253860847658","created_at":"2026-05-13T19:37:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2054647253860847658"],"id":"2054647253860847658","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":3507,"like_count":70,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":6},"text":"翻着过去的照片和视频 总觉得之前故事从我脑海中闪过有一些难以言表的情绪 翻到那些没被我完全消化的爱或恨 好像在此时在我的心中堵塞住了 发现时间过去了 又好像什么都没带走 搁置下来的一切被重复翻阅后有种不知道该说些什么都感觉 那些恨海情天一股脑的 仿佛那些痛才让我真正觉得我活着","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2054647253860847658"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2054646204844392680","created_at":"2026-05-13T19:33:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2054646204844392680"],"id":"2054646204844392680","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":7598,"like_count":123,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":26},"text":"我这一生都会对我爱的人付出真心 以前会 以后也会","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2054646204844392680"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2054646117036683384","created_at":"2026-05-13T19:33:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2054646117036683384"],"id":"2054646117036683384","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":11840,"like_count":259,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":37},"text":"我要成为你的 最好 最坏 最恨 最爱","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2054646117036683384"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2054626422019559695","created_at":"2026-05-13T18:14:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2054626422019559695"],"id":"2054626422019559695","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":5076,"like_count":84,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":20},"text":"你和我多深入一点，你会发现我有明显的智力低下的情况","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2054626422019559695"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2054570203351224715","created_at":"2026-05-13T14:31:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2054570203351224715"],"id":"2054570203351224715","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2630,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":3},"text":"最近在做什么呢。\n你的近况我已经许久没有得知了。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2054570203351224715"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2054569766397042916","created_at":"2026-05-13T14:29:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2054569766397042916"],"id":"2054569766397042916","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2170,"like_count":33,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"text":"你以为我看着淡淡的对什么都不在意，其实是被生活打傻了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2054569766397042916"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2054521727968026665","created_at":"2026-05-13T11:18:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2054521727968026665"],"id":"2054521727968026665","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2303,"like_count":31,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"text":"天才并不代表着成功和一帆风顺","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2054521727968026665"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2054355851323081128","created_at":"2026-05-13T00:19:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2054355851323081128"],"id":"2054355851323081128","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":2389,"like_count":45,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":0},"text":"在“发现问题”和“解决问题”中间不要加“为解决不了问题而焦虑”这一步","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2054355851323081128"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2054241415270637799","created_at":"2026-05-12T16:44:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2054241415270637799"],"id":"2054241415270637799","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":25,"impression_count":18749,"like_count":365,"quote_count":12,"reply_count":52,"retweet_count":76},"text":"一想到世界上有你的存在就感到好幸福。很多时候我只是想静静地和你待在一起，就这么浪费一天，什么事都不做也没关系","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2054241415270637799"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2054219865171595399","created_at":"2026-05-12T15:19:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2054219865171595399"],"id":"2054219865171595399","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,